*> vybe-test: cobol/accept_forms/stop_run_in_conditional
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_accept_forms.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 1.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF FLAG = 0
        STOP RUN
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "CONTINUED".
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "CONTINUED" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "CONTINUED"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [CONTINUED] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

